  "description": "Despite being only 163 cm tall, Lee Jin-soo was the ace of his high school basketball team. Kim Woo-jin is a college freshman who tried to enjoy basketball as a hobby. But after meeting Lee Jin-soo and seeing his greatness, his feelings for basketball start to change.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/home?seriesId=53350046), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/8025), [BattleComics](https://www.battlecomics.co.kr/webtoons/1125), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=4392153)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://inkr.com/ik-title-370)  \n[Thai](https://www.wecomics.in.th/comics/13214)  \nOfficial English: [INKR](https://comics.inkr.com/title/370-rim-ding-dong?utm_source=mud)",
